y]] [[over]] [[the]] [[street]] [[and]] [[falls|fall]] [[into]] [[the]] [[tomatoes|tomato]]. [[There]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[name]] [[on]] [[it]]: Na. Mr Huy [[does|do]] [[not]] [[shout]] [[across]] [[the]] [[street]], [[because]] [[he]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[quiet]] [[man]]. [[He]] [[sits|sit]] [[at]] [[his]] [[desk]] [[and]] [[writes|write]] [[a]] [[letter]].`,`vn`:`M\u1ed9t bu\u1ed5i chi\u1ec1u, m\u1ed9t qu\u1ea3 b\u00f3ng bay v\u1ecdt qua \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng, r\u01a1i \u0111\u00fang v\u00e0o lu\u1ed1ng c\u00e0 chua. Tr\u00ean b\u00f3ng c\u00f3 ghi m\u1ed9t c\u00e1i t\u00ean: Na. \u00d4ng Huy kh\u00f4ng g\u1ecdi v\u1edbi sang b\u00ean kia \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng, v\u00ec \u00f4ng v\u1ed1n l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u1ea7m t\u00ednh. \u00d4ng ng\u1ed3i v\u00e0o b\u00e0n v\u00e0 vi\u1ebft m\u1ed9t l\u00e1 th\u01b0.`},{`en`:`[[Dear]] Na, [[I]] [[think]] [[this]] [[is|be]] [[your]] [[ball]]. [[It]] [[is|be]] [[in]] [[my]] [[garden]] [[now]]. [[The]] [[ball]] [[is|be]] [[fine]], [[but]] [[its]] [[white]] [[side]] [[is|be]] [[red]]. [[Its]] [[friend]], [[one]] [[of]] [[my]] [[big]] [[tomatoes|tomato]], [[is|be]] [[not]] [[so]] [[fine]].`,`vn`:`Na th\u00e2n m\u1ebfn, \u00d4ng ngh\u0129 \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 qu\u1ea3 b\u00f3ng c\u1ee7a ch\u00e1u. Gi\u1edd n\u00f3 \u0111ang n\u1eb1m trong v\u01b0\u1eddn \u00f4ng. Qu\u1ea3 b\u00f3ng kh\u00f4ng sao, ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 m\u1eb7t tr\u1eafng c\u1ee7a n\u00f3 b\u1ecb nhu\u1ed9m \u0111\u1ecf. C\u00f2n b\u1ea1n c\u1ee7a n\u00f3, m\u1ed9t qu\u1ea3 c\u00e0 chua to c\u1ee7a \u00f4ng, th\u00ec kh\u00f4ng \u1ed5n l\u1eafm.`},{`en`:`[[You]] [[may]] [[come]] [[and]] [[take]] [[it]] [[yourself]]. [[If]] [[I]] [[am|be]] [[not]] [[in]] [[the]] [[garden]], [[call]] [[my]] [[name]] [[at]] [[the]] [[door]]. [[You]] [[should]] [[also]] [[write]] [[your]] [[address]] [[on]] [[the]] [[ball]]. [[Then]] [[another]] [[ball]] [[can]] [[come]] [[home]] [[with]] [[a]] [[letter]] [[from]] [[me]].`,`vn`:`Ch\u00e1u c\u1ee9 t\u1ef1 sang m\u00e0 l\u1ea5y. N\u1ebfu \u00